B.XN=new A.p8("Time of Troubles","At the turn of the 16th and 17th centuries Muscovy fell into deep crisis. After Tsar Fyodor I died in 1598 the Rurik dynasty ended, and his younger brother Dmitry had died earlier. Boris Godunov\u2019s brief rule failed to stabilise the state and a struggle for the throne followed.",B.ae9)
