B.XP=new A.p8("False Dmitry I","False Dmitry claimed he had survived an attempt on Tsar Dmitry\u2019s life. Polish magnates, including the Mniszech family, backed his march on Moscow. In 1605 he entered the capital, married Marina Mniszech, and took the throne, but his rule faced strong opposition.",B.aht)
